WEBVTT

00:07:25.608 --> 00:07:30.571
I was just so happy
that my friend was still here to hug.

00:07:32.698 --> 00:07:35.326
Election officials deserve a warm,

00:07:35.367 --> 00:07:40.372
welcoming community where their hard
work is celebrated and encouraged,

00:07:40.372 --> 00:07:41.790
not vilified.

00:07:42.833 --> 00:07:45.794
And all of this is exactly
why I'm so excited

00:07:45.836 --> 00:07:49.882
that we are inviting every single
election department in the United States

00:07:49.924 --> 00:07:52.551
to join the US Alliance
for Election Excellence.

00:07:52.593 --> 00:07:57.306
(Applause)

00:07:57.348 --> 00:08:00.684
The Alliance is a place where election
officials and technologists